Subject: [PATCH] FIN-003: Make settlement the sole contest finalization owner

Strip leaderboard Complete and wallet refunds. Settlement handles
empty cancel, single-participant idempotent refund, and prize credits
under advisory lock. Add concurrent idempotency + CI ownership guards.
